      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">If a model has a grot rigger, the grot can attempt repairs at the end of the movement phase. Roll a D6, on a roll of a 2+, this model regains 1 wounds lost earlier in the battle.</characteristic>
