            <profile name="Prophet of Da Great Waaagh!" typeId="10e3-235b-fd89-87a6" typeName="Abillities" hidden="false" id="6eb6-4807-caab-098a">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">While a Friendly Ork Unit is within 6&quot; of this model, each time a model in that unit makes a melee attack, add 1 to the Hit roll and add 1 to the Wound roll and if the Waaagh! is active for your army, a Critical Hit is scored on a successful unmodified Hit roll of 5+.</characteristic>
