                        <characteristic name="D" typeId="805f-6ece-e727-1ac1">D6</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="90e1-1023-d27e-1bb2">Instead of making a wound roll for this weapon, roll 2D6. If the result is equal to or greater than the target&apos;s Toughness, the attack successfully wounds.</characteristic>
