                        <characteristic name="D" typeId="805f-6ece-e727-1ac1">D6</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="90e1-1023-d27e-1bb2">This Weapon automatically hits its target. If the Target is a VEHICLE that can FLY, you roll 2D6 for damage and discard the lowest. If a VEHICLE unit that FLYS is destroyed, it automatically crashes and burns.</characteristic>
